    {
      "title": "How it works",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "MongoDB recommends redirecting stderr to a separate file because errors and deprecation warnings can disrupt scripts expecting particular output. That file also provides warnings to review when maintaining scripts. (low confidence)",
