          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MongoDB recommends writing scripts against a tested CLI version, reviewing release notes before upgrades, and replacing deprecated commands. Its GitHub Action defaults to the latest CLI and offers a version input, so reproducible workflows need an explicit version choice. (high confidence) Sources: https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/cli/current/atlas-cli-automate.md ; https://github.com/mongodb/atlas-github-action",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/cli/current/atlas-cli-automate.md",
