    {
      "title": "Comparisons and alternatives",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "The snapshot-export implementation tutorial composes Atlas CLI and AWS CLI commands, saves JSON responses, extracts role and endpoint identifiers with jq, and checks endpoint status before configuring dependent resources. It is an example workflow rather than evidence that arbitrary reruns are idempotent. (low confidence)",
