    {
      "title": "Facts and statements",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Atlas CLI commands can be used in scripts to automate processes. Sources: https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/cli/current/atlas-cli-automate.md",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/cli/current/atlas-cli-automate.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:10d31c14289a540dcf300fb0977094e9074ae6401ad4e76450bc95e6c264fc8b",
          "validationStatus": "REMEDIATED-PROJECTION",
          "evidenceIds": [],
          "also": [
            "https://www.prisma.io/dataguide/mongodb/mongodb-atlas-setup"
          ],
          "originValidationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "originEvidenceIds": [
            "ev:1f27ee00d41b59848d3115b682e9852235c6ebf9bbf2f002087371fbac759a59",
            "ev:f5a1db0ace9b4af642a81323070281b99f0a731904e6435ca0fea58c8599a042"
          ],
          "remediation": {
            "schema": "claim-remediation-projection/v1",
            "record": "remediation.json",
            "requires_revalidation": true,
            "claim_text_sha256": "feeab7dc9e2ad2d8a82f0651d83fb641dcb3f22bc05d014a82490f37e8e5ddd6"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "For unattended scripts, service-account client ID and client secret can be supplied through MONGODB_ATLAS_CLIENT_ID and MONGODB_ATLAS_CLIENT_SECRET. The official Action demonstrates mapping repository secrets to these variables; API-key variables are another supported option. (high confidence) Sources: https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/cli/current/atlas-cli-env-variables.md ; https://github.com/mongodb/atlas-github-action",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/cli/current/atlas-cli-env-variables.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:b0db1a0c56cdb859e16bd29d0baf46643d876b85273050cd9e0cf528bd609c32",
          "validationStatus": "REMEDIATED-PROJECTION",
          "evidenceIds": [],
          "also": [
            "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/cli/current/atlas-cli-temporary-cluster.md",
            "https://github.com/mongodb/atlas-github-action"
          ],
          "originValidationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "originEvidenceIds": [
            "ev:1caab6a2e0fb3b405a0fbaafa2df9dace3e2311f5ffd5cb981afc9b18c1ff2bd",
            "ev:d026fe08dd28b6ea8d4e54ce3fcc90372558989ab1848e4a1016b85bef5f5d40",
            "ev:de567abb9c30cb152f9ba6fdea841268cce4fc351a32f947f634a48a6bb2fec9"
          ],
          "remediation": {
            "schema": "claim-remediation-projection/v1",
            "record": "remediation.json",
            "requires_revalidation": true,
            "claim_text_sha256": "ce8a719ed9bc03aaabfb67cd48708baf6845c1017cd54b3c6975c2c3811fcfc6"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Configuration environment variables override stored profile settings. An explicit --projectId overrides both the environment variable and profile. MongoDB warns against mixing MongoDB CLI and Atlas CLI environment-variable families. (high confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/cli/current/atlas-cli-env-variables.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:a5d62027537b3261c4f825b79aa273b4a2c8177416eeb01ae4ef9ae7fe783e76",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:515b974d677c52998b835fbd1ed5e314afc9f60c319f8ac813c89311a6e61d3b"
          ],
          "also": [
            "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/cli/current/connect-atlas-cli.md"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MongoDB recommends building scripts against the installed Atlas CLI version, avoiding automatic CLI upgrades inside scripts, and reviewing release notes for breaking changes and deprecations before upgrading. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/cli/current/atlas-cli-automate.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:8d06521062e6127664d9d3108f4e7f074cfc0bf84d282d245ca54ade5728a33a",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:bbeee5097b7970996c7a2b75b86f7a59540cdf78328bb37fcf8b4e732c520352"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Prisma's provisioning guide follows atlas clusters create with atlas clusters watch to wait for cluster readiness before subsequent use. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.prisma.io/dataguide/mongodb/mongodb-atlas-setup",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:a1e3c33963483e776c361af3fca2031d27140f0214b45f1f9dc1e7c593796032",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:bb02684be9dacf4c3dc795a67c234152dee46dc5b835f61c0289f042d92cbdaa"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Temporary-environment automation can create a project and cluster, expose a connection string to tests, then delete the cluster and project; both MongoDB's tutorial and its official GitHub Action document this lifecycle. (high confidence) Sources: https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/cli/current/atlas-cli-temporary-cluster.md ; https://github.com/mongodb/atlas-github-action",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/cli/current/atlas-cli-temporary-cluster.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:9b14ddccc387ccdf2c9dd77432f98587afa3c31f26acca7b5772c0dc042b28bb",
          "validationStatus": "REMEDIATED-PROJECTION",
