            "ev:c273e9bc4a29562859e02ec0f8ed2736f09fb2eea8e6b18805fe7b7a9097aaa1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A January 20, 2026 issue reports HttpError: Bad credentials while atlas-github-action@v0.2.0 invokes oprypin/find-latest-tag@v1 to discover an Atlas CLI release. The reporter says this occurs before CLI installation, so the report does not establish an Atlas API authentication defect. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://github.com/mongodb/atlas-github-action/issues/30",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:eeb0a82491cf04eb76189709ec33fd239aef47c5ece63531e66003b5faeac752",
