          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Atlas CLI supports scripting Atlas control-plane operations. MongoDB documents automation workflows, and its official GitHub Action runs CLI commands in workflow shell steps. (high confidence) Sources: https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/cli/current/atlas-cli-automate.md ; https://github.com/mongodb/atlas-github-action",
